        "text": "grandmother"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "mother"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "爸爸的妈妈就是奶奶（祖母），英文是 grandmother。aunt 是阿姨/姑姑，sister 是姐妹，mother 是妈妈。",
    "hint": "father 是爸爸，father's mother 就是爸爸的妈妈，也就是……",
