        "label": "A",
        "text": "bread"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "apple"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "rice"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "chicken"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "apple（苹果）是水果。bread 是面包，rice 是米饭，chicken 是鸡肉，它们都不是水果。",
    "hint": "这种食物长在树上，红红的、圆圆的，很甜。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 20,
