  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1503",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 3,
    "grade_max": 4,
    "difficulty": 2,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "简单句型"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "Choose the correct sentence: (选择正确的句子)",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "I am a student."
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "I is a student."
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "I are a student."
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "I be a student."
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "主语 I（我）后面要用 am。be 动词的搭配规则：I am, you are, he/she/it is。所以正确的说法是 \"I am a student.\"（我是一名学生。）",
    "hint": "I 后面跟的 be 动词是什么形式？am, is, 还是 are？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1504",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 3,
    "grade_max": 4,
    "difficulty": 2,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "简单句型"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "____ is a teacher. (He/She/It)",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "He am"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "He is"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "He are"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "He be"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "He（他）后面要用 is。规则：I → am, He/She/It → is, You/We/They → are。所以 \"He is a teacher.\" 是正确的。",
    "hint": "He, She, It 后面跟的 be 动词都是同一个形式。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
