        "text": "on"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "in"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "under"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "behind"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "\"在……下面\"用介词 under。on 是\"在……上面\"，in 是\"在……里面\"，behind 是\"在……后面\"。",
    "hint": "中文说\"在桌子下面\"，想想\"下面\"对应的英文介词是什么。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
